      "content": "That sounds incredibly painful, and I'm so sorry you're going through this. The feeling of vanishing and an overwhelming void can be a part of the grief process, but it's also important to recognize your own struggles. Healing takes time and sometimes, it's okay to take small steps toward regaining a sense of self. If you're open to it, those small steps can eventually bring healing, even when it feels nearly impossible. I'm here to listen and support you however I can.",
      "source": "target",
